<ul>
<li><strong>正三角形（左）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M40,0 L0,30 40,60 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>正三角形（上）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M0,40 L30,0 60,40 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>正三角形（右）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M0,0 L40,30 0,60 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>正三角形（下）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M0,0 L30,40 60,0 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>矩形：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M0,0 L1,0 L1,1 L0,1 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>圆形：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M100,50 C100,77.614237 77.614237,100 50,100 C22.385763,100 0,77.614237 0,50 C0,22.385763 22.385763,0 50,0 C77.614237,0 100,22.385763 100,50 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>箭头（左）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M40,0 L0,30 40,60&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>箭头（上）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M0,40 L30,0 60,40&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>箭头（右）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M0,0 L40,30 0,60&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>箭头（下）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M0,0 L30,40 60,0&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>半圆（左）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M34,0 L34,68 C15.222317,68 0,52.777684 0,34 0,15.222319 15.222317,3.5762787E-07 34,0 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>半圆（上）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M34,0 C52.777684,7.1525574E-07 68,15.222319 68,34.000001 L0,34.000001 C3.5762787E-07,15.222319 15.222319,7.1525574E-07 34,0 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>半圆（右）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M0,0 C18.777683,3.5762787E-07 34,15.222319 34,34 34,52.777684 18.777683,68 0,68 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>半圆（下）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M0,0 L68,0 C68,18.777681 52.777684,34 34,34 15.222319,34 3.5762787E-07,18.777681 0,0 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>椭圆矩形（水平）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M34,0 L76,0 C94.777683,9.8347664E-07 110,15.222319 110,34.000001 110,52.777684 94.777683,68.000001 76,68.000001 L34,68.000001 C15.222317,68.000001 0,52.777684 0,34.000001 0,15.222319 15.222317,9.8347664E-07 34,0 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>椭圆矩形（垂直）：</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M34.000001,0 C52.777684,0 68.000001,15.222321 68.000001,34 L68.000001,76 C68.000001,94.777681 52.777684,110 34.000001,110 15.222319,110 8.9406967E-07,94.777681 0,76 L0,34 C8.9406967E-07,15.222321 15.222319,0 34.000001,0 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
<li><strong>菱形:</strong>&lt;Path Data=&ldquo;M150,0 L0,75 0,225 150,300 300,225 300,75 z&rdquo; Stretch=&ldquo;Uniform&rdquo;/&gt;</li>
</ul>
<p><code>Stretch</code> 默认使用 <code>Uniform</code>，在这种参数下矩形为正方形、圆形为正圆形，如果修改 <code>Stretch</code> 为 <code>Fill</code>，则根据容器高宽进行自由拉伸。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>常用 Dotnet 资源整合</title><link>https://blog.frhello.com/%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8-dotnet-%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E6%95%B4%E5%90%88/</link><pubDate>Wed, 31 Aug 2016 20:30:04 +0800</pubDate><author>作者</author><guid>https://blog.frhello.com/%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8-dotnet-%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E6%95%B4%E5%90%88/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="微软相关平台资源">微软相关平台资源</h2>
